"{\"url\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/project/prj_1KVN4NCR11S0HD23\",\"title\":\"Patagonia WoodCell I — Isometric\",\"head\":[\"UNDER VALIDATION\",\"BICRS\",\"Patagonia WoodCell I\",\"Patagonia Green\",\"->\",\"PROJECT DETAILS\",\"Expected first certificates\",\"2027\",\"Project code\",\"4Y6X\",\"Crediting period\",\"01 Dec 2026 to 01 Dec 2036\"],\"issued_header\":null,\"buffer_header\":null,\"crediting\":null,\"verifier\":null,\"code\":\"4Y6X\",\"approval\":\"Expected 2027\",\"protocol_current\":\"Subsurface Biomass Carbon Removal and Storage v1.2\",\"protocol_baseline\":null,\"cert_issued\":null,\"cert_retired\":null,\"cert_buffer\":null,\"reversal\":null,\"showing\":[\"Showing 2 of 2\"],\"tables\":[{\"heads\":[\"Submission date\",\"Title\",\"Download\"],\"rows\":[[\"10 Sep 2026\",\"Explanatory Note\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"09 Sep 2026\",\"PDD\",\"PDF | ->\"]]}],\"links\":[{\"h\":\"https://patagonia.green\",\"t\":\"Patagonia Green\"},{\"h\":\"/protocol/subsurface-biomass/1.2\",\"t\":\"Subsurface Biomass Carbon Removal and Storage v1.2\"},{\"h\":\"/supplier/spl_1K3NBRD4J1S0XYPM\",\"t\":\"Learn more\"},{\"h\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/standard#validation-and-verification-requirements\",\"t\":\"Isometric Standard\"},{\"h\":\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1KOmLuhU6yzCYYtUWPyQCw4aByEEJ7Q1-/view\",\"t\":\"VVB Policy\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1K3NBRD4J1S0XYPM/prj_1KVN4NCR11S0HD23/pjd_1M25PKPXE1S0SXXZ/explanatory_note.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1K3NBRD4J1S0XYPM/prj_1KVN4NCR11S0HD23/pjd_1M23GB9JP1S00C6S/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"}],\"text\":\"UNDER VALIDATION\\nBICRS\\nPatagonia WoodCell I\\nPatagonia Green\\n->\\nPROJECT DETAILS\\nExpected first certificates\\n2027\\nProject code\\n4Y6X\\nCrediting period\\n01 Dec 2026 to 01 Dec 2036\\nPROTOCOL DETAILS\\nCurrent protocol version\\nSubsurface Biomass Carbon Removal and Storage v1.2\\nPublic comment period\\nThis project is in a public comment period from 09 Sep 2026 until 18 Sep 2026. Please send feedback to project-feedback@isometric.com.\\nSummary\\n\\nPatagonia WoodCell I is a farm-based subsurface biomass carbon removal and storage initiative in Fresia, Chile. It uses non-merchantable & surplus eucalyptus biomass from legally managed monoculture plantations. Activities include sourcing, tracking, drying, weighing, engineered burial, cell closure and long-term monitoring, reducing decomposition/open-burning emissions, fuel loads and fire risk.\\n\\nFresia\\nHow carbon is being removed\\n\\nBiomass Carbon Removal and Storage (BiCRS) involves storing the carbon contained in waste biomass—organic material from living or recently living organisms. BiCRS works by halting or slowing the decomposition of biomass, enabling the carbon it contains to be stored long-term. This can be achieved by converting biomass into materials that decompose more slowly—such as biochar or bio-oil—or by storing it in environments where decomposition is slowed. For BiCRS to count as carbon removal, the biomass must be replenished to ensure additional carbon dioxide is drawn from the atmosphere.\\n\\nLearn more\\nProject timeline\\nCompleted 2026\\nInitial documentation submission\\nExpected 2027\\nIN PROGRESS\\nAudit kick-off\\n\\nA Validation & Verification Body (VVB) officially commences the project validation and verification process. All VVBs are approved and appointed by Isometric based on the requirements outlined in the Isometric Standard and VVB Policy.\\n\\nExpected 2027\\nSite visit\\nExpected 2027\\nApproval date\\nExpected 2027\\nInitial credit issuance\\nProject documentation\\nSubmission date\\tTitle\\tDownload\\n10 Sep 2026\\tExplanatory Note\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n09 Sep 2026\\tPDD\\tPDF\\n->\\nShowing 2 of 2\\nPrevious\\nNext\"}"